OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and dry with some longer
OL,6,Fsunny periods developing during the
OL,7,Fafternoon in the south. Cloud will
OL,8,Fgradually thicken and lower in the
OL,9,Fnorth from late afternoon. Breezy
OL,10,Funtil later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOvernight cloudy with a band
OL,13,Fof rain, heavy at times moving in,
OL,14,Fsinking slowly southeastwards through
OL,15,Fthe region by dawn. Winds gradually
OL,16,Feasing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
