OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mild start with skies slowly
OL,6,Fclearing from the north from mid-
OL,7,Fmorning. Chance of some showers
OL,8,Fdeveloping during the afternoon and
OL,9,Fmore frequent along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCooler
OL,12,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,13,Fand isolated showers. Showers become
OL,14,Fmore frequent and heavier on Monday.
OL,15,FWinds mostly light, but breezy at
OL,16,Ftimes near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
